WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.664
Sign in with your company account.

5
00:00:02.664 --> 00:00:07.948
This recording uses fictional records, simulated location and a test camera.

9
00:00:07.948 --> 00:00:09.616
No live work is created.

13
00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:14.813
Set up the main contract, authorised sites and subcontractor access once.

17
00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:17.162
Invite the subcontractor administrator.

21
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:21.800
Their approved workers can then start work without waiting for an assignment.

25
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.847
Settings holds each contract’s line items and sub-line items.

29
00:00:26.847 --> 00:00:31.512
Codes stay in management records; workers see simple service names.

33
00:00:31.512 --> 00:00:35.620
Snow bands have an inclusive minimum and exclusive maximum.

37
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.222
No prices are included.

41
00:00:38.022 --> 00:00:42.757
Use the overview and NPI verification queue to review submitted work.

45
00:00:42.757 --> 00:00:44.542
The company reviews first.

49
00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:50.856
Current activity, open issues and exceptions are visible without creating daily assignments.

53
00:00:51.656 --> 00:00:57.634
Inspect the same crew, services, quantities and snow evidence that the company reviewed.

57
00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:01.234
Recorded, claimed and accepted hours remain separate.

61
00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:05.106
Multiple service lines do not multiply worker attendance.

65
00:01:05.906 --> 00:01:10.290
Accept the exact claimed hours or enter a correction with a reason.

69
00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.973
Return incomplete records to the company.

73
00:01:12.973 --> 00:01:17.161
Original photos, attendance and the review history are retained.

77
00:01:17.961 --> 00:01:26.698
The management workbook mirrors visits, line items, sub-line items, measurements, attendance and review history in seven tabs.

81
00:01:26.698 --> 00:01:30.719
Permitted planning edits return as NPI-reviewed proposals.

85
00:01:30.719 --> 00:01:34.325
Passwords and private image files stay out of cells.

89
00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:39.360
Configure NPI recipient emails and the daily summary in Settings.

93
00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:45.485
Apply the included migration and update the app, function and workbook script before live use.

97
00:01:45.485 --> 00:01:49.004
Test the full workflow with separate company accounts.
